# Memory-Bank Rules

Before backend work, read in order:

1. `memory-bank/core/agent-surface.md`
2. `memory-bank/core/architecture.md`
3. `memory-bank/core/testing-strategy.md`
4. `memory-bank/core/implementation-plan.md`

- Work one implementation-plan step at a time.
- Update `progress.md` after completing a step.
- Propose-only edits to `implementation-plan.md` unless explicitly asked.
- `memory-bank/core/**` and `memory-bank/agents/**` are controlled — no silent overwrites.
